---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { config } from '../lib/config';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Makeatimer handles browser storage, share links, contact messages, and advertising."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <article class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Updated September 29, 2026</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>
      Makeatimer is operated by {config.operator}.{' '}
      <a href="https://faxcorp.dev/company/">Company details</a>. For privacy
      questions, email <a href={`mailto:${config.email}`}>{config.email}</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Calculations and browser storage</h2>
    <p>
      Calculations run on your device. Makeatimer does not send your calculator
      inputs to a calculation server and does not have user accounts. Theme,
      sound preferences, and favourites are stored in your browser’s local
      storage. Active timing state is stored in session storage for recovery
      within the same tab. Clear site data in your browser to remove this
      information.
    </p>
    <h2>Share links</h2>
    <p>
      Share links place your inputs in the URL fragment, after the # character.
      The fragment is not part of the page’s HTTP request. Recipients and
      scripts running on the page can read it, so do not use a shared link for
      confidential information.
    </p>
    <h2>Page delivery</h2>
    <p>
      When hosted, the site’s infrastructure provider processes connection
      information such as IP addresses and request details to deliver and
      protect the website. Makeatimer does not maintain a separate database of
      calculator inputs.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact messages</h2>
    <p>
      If you email us, we use the information you provide to respond and
      investigate your request. Avoid sending sensitive information that is
      unnecessary for resolving the issue.
    </p>
    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    {config.ads ? (
      <>
        <p>
          Google AdSense advertising is configured on this site. Advertising is
          requested only when the installed consent manager permits it. Google
          and its partners may process device information and use cookies or
          similar storage according to your preferences. See{' '}
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">
            Google’s partner-site privacy information
          </a>
          .
        </p>
        <p>
          Use Ad preferences in the footer to manage your choices. The tools
          work when advertising permission is refused or scripts are blocked.
        </p>
      </>
    ) : (
      <p>
        Advertising is disabled in this version. No advertising or analytics
        scripts are loaded by Makeatimer.
      </p>
    )}
    <h2>Your requests</h2>
    <p>
      Contact us for questions about information you have provided, including
      access or deletion requests. You can also contact your local data
      protection authority. We will update this page if the site’s data
      practices change.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
